#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:99
#: 0d8e565c0fa14ee68b47deda9c942f14
msgid ""
"README FSM is **HOME / HOLD / OCS2** (`3` = OCS2). Source also constructs"
" `StateMoveJ` for canonical `/fsm_command` `4` (and IK MoveL when "
"`lina_planning` is present). **Do not copy the Basic Joint MoveJ table "
"here.** Declare-time deltas vs Basic Joint: `movej_interpolation_type` "
"default `\"linear\"`, `movej_trajectory_blend_ratio` `0.2`. Waist keys, "
"when `waist_lifting_enabled`, follow the Basic Joint waist table (only "
"`waist_lifting_duration` is Runtime)."
msgstr ""
"README 的 FSM 是 **HOME / HOLD / OCS2**（`3` = OCS2）。源码还会为规范 `/fsm_command` "
"`4` 构造 `StateMoveJ`（有 `lina_planning` 时还有 IK MoveL）。**MoveJ 参数以 Basic "
"Joint 页为准，此处不重复整表。** 相对 Basic Joint 的声明期差值：`movej_interpolation_type` 默认 "
"`\"linear\"`，`movej_trajectory_blend_ratio` 为 `0.2`。启用 "
"`waist_lifting_enabled` 时腰部键沿用 Basic Joint 腰部表（只有 "
"`waist_lifting_duration` 是运行时）。"

